config LVX_USE_DEMO_CONTEST2026_435_MIRUI_DEMO
	bool "Contest 2026 team 435 mirui three-body demo (Rust)"
	default n
	depends on VIDEO_FB
	---help---
		Enable the contest 2026 team 435 (UdifyFun) port of the mirui
		no_std ECS UI framework (https://mirui.rs, MIT). Renders the
		upstream three-body physics demo on the round screen through
		the NuttX framebuffer backend and software renderer.
		Requires nightly cargo with -Zbuild-std for the
		thumbv8m.main-nuttx-eabihf target.
